269
00:24:15.788 --> 00:24:17.623
Tell your friend to get out
of the fucking car!

270
00:24:17.706 --> 00:24:20.668
- OK. Fuck.
- Tell him to get out of the fucking car!

271
00:24:27.132 --> 00:24:29.093
