Yeah?

305
00:29:06.411 --> 00:29:07.496
Where' s the trooper?

306
00:29:08.205 --> 00:29:09.081
It was abandoned.

307
00:29:15.295 --> 00:29:17.214
- You guys even know where you are?
- No.

308
00:29:20.425 --> 00:29:22.928
- We were hoping for your help.
- You guys got money?

309
00:29:23.553 --> 00:29:25.847
